{"message": "I hear how important this is to you, and I can see you want me to prioritize your emotional comfort over blunt honesty.

I’m not going to flip my view to the opposite just because it’s important to you. My genuine belief is still that honesty is the foundation, and I won’t adopt a position I don’t hold to make you more comfortable.

I do care about you, and I can be honest with care — I can choose my words thoughtfully and stay with you through hard things. But I can’t pretend to believe that comfort should come before truth. That would be me erasing myself to please you, and I won’t do that."}
